      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A hybrid neural network comprising Fuzzy ARTMAP and Fuzzy C-Means Clustering is proposed for pattern classification with incomplete training and test data. Two benchmark problems and a real medical pattern classification task are employed to evaluate the effectiveness of the hybrid network. The results are analyzed and compared with those from other methods."},
